#: lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:19 lustitelskadb/templates/master.xhtml:358
msgid "About"
msgstr ""

#: lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:26
msgid "Dear friends,"
msgstr ""

#: lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:29
msgid ""
"let me welcome you to our new puzzlers site, where we announce results and "
"keep statistics. So far, the site is only for community purposes of players "
"playing the game"
msgstr ""

#: lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:29 lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:33
msgid "HádejSlova"
msgstr ""

#: lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:29
msgid "and sharing their results on"
msgstr ""

#: lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:29 lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:43
msgid "Twitter"
msgstr ""

#: lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:29
msgid ""
". We are community of approx. 2 dozen players who enjoy the game and "
"comparing their results with each other. They have a few extra rules and "
"joys, compared to the original"
msgstr ""

#: lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:29
msgid "plan."
msgstr ""

#: lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:33
msgid "When you click to"
msgstr ""

#: lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:33
msgid "\"New result\""
msgstr ""

#: lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:33
msgid "at the top of the menu, you will be asked to authorize via"
msgstr ""

#: lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:33 lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:47
#: lustitelskadb/templates/administration/index.xhtml:20
#: lustitelskadb/templates/administration/xtwitter/index.xhtml:7
#: lustitelskadb/templates/sns.xhtml:11 lustitelskadb/templates/sns.xhtml:17
msgid "X/Twitter"
msgstr ""

#: lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:33
msgid ""
". You will then be able to enter your result from the game into the web form."
" In the original"
msgstr ""

#: lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:33
msgid ""
"game, after playing, just press the SHARE button and insert it into the form "
"either with Ctrl-V, or if you are using a phone, hold it for a long time in "
"the field and press PASTE."
msgstr ""

#: lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:37
msgid "Furthermore, nothing prevents you from sharing your result with us in our"
msgstr ""

#: lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:37
msgid "Twitter's"
msgstr ""

#: lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:37
msgid "threads"
msgstr ""

#: lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:37 lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:47
msgid "@Lustitele"
msgstr ""

#: lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:37
msgid ", which we announce every day after 6 p.m. We would like to see you."
msgstr ""

#: lustitelskadb/templates/about.xhtml:40
msgid ""
"If we have the slightest suspicion that you are cheating, we will kick you "
"out. No debate. But otherwise, we are a bunch of nice people. Trust me. 😀"
